": [{"text": "", "id": 0, "time": "0", "image": "engenn6le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm sorry I haven't given you a chance, Marco. I'd better stop being so quick to judge. I know you're trying. You came all the way out here to see me and I'm foolishly wasting time being overly sensitive.<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: No, V. I'm sorry. I apologize for saying the things I said. I know I can be annoyingly pushy at times. I ought to be more aware of how my words come across.", "id": 1, "time": "100", "image": "engenn6le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: It's OK. I've got to stop being so needy. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: You're not needy ... you're just emotional. That's OK. I've got to respect your feelings and not belittle them. <br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I appreciate you acknowledging that. It really makes me love you more. You can be so understanding and sweet. I'm going to have to remember that ...", "id": 2, "time": "24000", "image": "engenn6le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, {"text": "<span class=\"strong\">Marco</span>: You'd better not lose your sassiness ... I like it! It's an endearing quality, you know. Keeps things spicy - you know, I like spice in my food and in my women!<br>\n<span class=\"strong\">Vanessa</span>: I'm going to have to remember that when I make dinner next.", "id": 3, "time": "45000", "image": "engenn6le12ob05re2img13.jpg"}], "audiosrc": "engenn6le12ob05re2aud01", "coverimg": "engenn6le12ob05re2img05.jpg"}, "type": "slideshow"}], "_data": [], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1}]}]}